<title>USA: Charter One, RCSB merger clears SEC.</title>
<headline>Charter One, RCSB merger clears SEC.</headline>
<dateline>CLEVELAND 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Charter One Financial Inc and RCSB Financial Inc said Tuesday that their proposed merger has been cleared by the Securities and Exchange Commission.</p>
<p>The proposed merger between Charter One and RCSB remains subject to approval by shareholders of both companies.</p>
<p>The merger also is pending approval by the Office of Thrift Supervision and the New York Superintendent of Banks, they said. If the deal is cleared by regulatory authorities and shareholders, it is expected to be closed as early as October 3, the companies said.</p>
<p>((-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610))</p>
</text>
